OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786006084
OL,3,C'Dangerous and violent' man who
OL,4,Cattacked two women with hammer and
OL,5,Cknife jailed
OL,7,FA "dangerous and violent" man who
OL,8,Fattacked two women with a hammer and a
OL,9,Fknife in Kent has been jailed.
OL,11,FGerard Parkinson was convicted of
OL,12,Fattempted murder following an assault
OL,13,Fon two women he knew at an address in
OL,14,FBonney Way, Swanley.
OL,16,FKent Police said on 1 March 2023, he
OL,17,Fapproached the first victim in the
OL,18,Fkitchen and struck her head with a
OL,19,Fclub hammer, causing her to fall
OL,20,Funconscious to the ground.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
