PN,38202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786006084
OL,3,C'Dangerous and violent' man who
OL,4,Cattacked two women with hammer and
OL,5,Cknife jailed
OL,7,FParkinson then went to a room upstairs
OL,8,Fwhere the second victim was asleep. He
OL,9,Fstabbed her in the chest with a knife
OL,10,Fand also hit her head with the hammer.
OL,12,FPolice said she managed to wrestle the
OL,13,Fweapon from him while her screams
OL,14,Falerted a relative who came to help.
OL,15,FHe took the knife from Parkinson and
OL,16,Fsuffered cuts to his hand whilst the
OL,17,Fvictim fled the house.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
