FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786006084
OL,3,C'Dangerous and violent' man who
OL,4,Cattacked two women with hammer and
OL,5,Cknife jailed
OL,7,FParkinson then attacked the other
OL,8,Fvictim with the hammer again as she
OL,9,Fwas leaving the building having
OL,10,Fregained consciousness.
OL,12,FA neighbour restrained Parkinson on
OL,13,Fthe ground until the arrival of the
OL,14,Fpolice.
OL,16,FBoth victims were taken to hospital
OL,17,Fwhere they were treated for multiple
OL,18,Fserious injuries. One suffered a
OL,19,Fpunctured lung.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/7
