CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786006084
OL,3,C'Dangerous and violent' man who
OL,4,Cattacked two women with hammer and
OL,5,Cknife jailed
OL,7,FParkinson, of Parkhill Road, Sidcup,
OL,8,Fdenied trying to kill his victims and
OL,9,Fwas convicted of two counts of
OL,10,Fattempted murder following a trial at
OL,11,FMaidstone Crown Court.
OL,13,FThe 64-year-old had previously
OL,14,Fadmitted perverting the course of
OL,15,Fjustice, after making a phone call to
OL,16,Fone of the victims whilst in custody
OL,17,Fto try and persuade her to withdraw
OL,18,Fthe allegations.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786006084
OL,3,C'Dangerous and violent' man who
OL,4,Cattacked two women with hammer and
OL,5,Cknife jailed
OL,7,FParkinson was handed a 28 year prison
OL,8,Fsentence and will have to serve an
OL,9,Fadditional 5 years on licence upon
OL,10,Frelease.
OL,12,FDetective Sergeant Ashley Evans said:
OL,13,F"Parkinson is a dangerous and violent
OL,14,Findividual responsible for a brutal
OL,15,Fand unprovoked attack on two
OL,16,Fdefenceless women within their own
OL,17,Fhome.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
