OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786006084
OL,3,C'Dangerous and violent' man who
OL,4,Cattacked two women with hammer and
OL,5,Cknife jailed
OL,7,F"One of the victims bravely fought him
OL,8,Foff as he tried to kill her while she
OL,9,Fslept, as evidenced by the multiple
OL,10,Flacerations to her hands.
OL,12,F"Had she not managed to shout out and
OL,13,Freceive assistance it is highly likely
OL,14,Fthe assault would have been fatal.
OL,16,F"Both victims have shown tremendous
OL,17,Fcourage in supporting our
OL,18,Finvestigation and in having to also
OL,19,Fendure a court trial.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
